WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Let's see how to use product targeting in your sponsored brands campaign.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.083
Say you're advertising kids' sunscreens.

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:10.000
In the targeting section, choose product targeting.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.105
First, you can target entire categories of products, add or refine our suggested categories, or

00:00:17.105 --> 00:00:19.000
search for ones yourself.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.526
Or you can target individual products.

00:00:21.526 --> 00:00:27.000
Use our suggestions, search, or you can enter a list, or upload one.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Now, your ad will be eligible to show when the products you target appear in customer shopping results.
